    "detailed_description": "<h1>Dive into post-apocalyptic vibes. Wishlist Now</h1><p></p><br><h1>Experience the cyber club vibe. Wishlist Now</h1><p></p><br><h1>Experience survival challenges. Wishlist Now</h1><p></p><br><h1>Explore fantasy realms. Wishlist Now</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><br><br>Embark on &quot;Time Journey,&quot; an immersive adventure set within the enigmatic confines of an alien laboratory. With no memory of your past or knowledge of your presence in this alien realm, you must explore, solve puzzles, and interact with the environment to uncover the truth about your identity and the purpose of your mysterious surroundings.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845100/extras/99fa9edf04b01533f7a1e41ca2ee9b45.poster.avif?t=1754494977\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845100/extras/99fa9edf04b01533f7a1e41ca2ee9b45.webm?t=1754494977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845100/extras/99fa9edf04b01533f7a1e41ca2ee9b45.mp4?t=1754494977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Key Features:<br>\t\u2022\tMysterious Sci-Fi Setting: Explore the complex and secretive corridors of an alien lab, brimming with advanced technology and clandestine secrets eager for discovery.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845100/extras/b9b5b2abc30e2d2fa8df7cd91a47413b.poster.avif?t=1754494977\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845100/extras/b9b5b2abc30e2d2fa8df7cd91a47413b.webm?t=1754494977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845100/extras/b9b5b2abc30e2d2fa8df7cd91a47413b.mp4?t=1754494977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\t\u2022\tIdentity Discovery: Piece together your character's background by gathering clues and leveraging the lab's alien tech, weaving a narrative that bridges science fiction with deep personal exploration.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845100/extras/c3ee3a5da0c7c59351d44440a18ae766.poster.avif?t=1754494977\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845100/extras/c3ee3a5da0c7c59351d44440a18ae766.webm?t=1754494977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845100/extras/c3ee3a5da0c7c59351d44440a18ae766.mp4?t=1754494977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\t\u2022\tEngaging Puzzle-Solving: Solve intricate puzzles using the lab's mechanisms, each solution drawing you closer to unraveling the greater mystery at hand.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845100/extras/df65272af863d8f46268dba3781e3145.poster.avif?t=1754494977\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845100/extras/df65272af863d8f46268dba3781e3145.webm?t=1754494977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845100/extras/df65272af863d8f46268dba3781e3145.mp4?t=1754494977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\t\u2022\tDynamic NPC Interactions: Engage in meaningful dialogue with a host of NPC characters residing within the lab. These interactions can provide valuable insights, reveal underlying lore, and influence the course of your journey.<br><br>&quot;Time Journey&quot; is a thought-provoking exploration and puzzle-solving game set against a science fiction backdrop. As players navigate through the alien laboratory, they will encounter various NPCs, each with their own stories and information that can aid in piecing together the player's past and the lab's mysteries. Time manipulation plays a crucial role in both puzzle-solving and narrative progression, offering a unique twist on traditional gameplay mechanics.",
